# MANDATORY: TRANSOVO MCTB PAGE-BY-PAGE BUILD SPECS

**Index:** `docs/TRANSOVO-MCTB-PAGE-BUILD-SPECS.md`  
**Prerequisites:** product scope → IA map → page manifest → canonical map (all `transovo-mctb-*.mdc` except page specs)  
**Applies with:** All Transovo standards (always).

## When this rule activates

**Before implementing or declaring complete** any MCTB page UI — read governing MCTB docs, then the **page-specific build spec** for that route.

## Authority order (MCTB implementation)

1. Product scope
2. IA & navigation map
3. Page inventory & route manifest (completeness)
4. Canonical product map (domain/lifecycle)
5. **Page build spec for the route being built**
6. Transovo standards
7. Appointment screenshots (visual only)

