## Hard requirements (all pages)

- Appointment screenshots = visual language only
- Page manifest = nothing omitted
- Page build spec = exact screen implementation
- Real runtime data; no mock analytics or fake controls
- Shared Transovo shell unless public/onboarding/admin exception

## Governing sentence

**Manifest says what must exist; page build specs say how each screen is built.**
